[{"authors":null,"categories":null,"content":"我目前是 MBZUAI Metaverse Lab 的博士生，即将进入毕业阶段，师从 Hao Li，研究以空间理解为基础的多模态智能。我致力于构建能够理解与生成二维、三维、视频及四维内容的视觉语言模型与生成模型。代表作包括 Perceptio 、UCanDance、PointNeXt 和 3D-CoMPaT 。\n我正在寻找 2027 年开始的研究科学家、博士后及产业研究机会，方向包括多模态视觉语言模型、空间推理、世界模型和生成式人工智能。\n","date":-62135596800,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"section","lang":"zh","lastmod":-62135596800,"objectID":"4c11027a3a3d9b3e87167672573c4756","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/authors/admin/","publishdate":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/authors/admin/","section":"authors","summary":"我目前是 MBZUAI Metaverse Lab 的博士生，即将进入毕业阶段，师从 Hao Li，研究以空间理解为基础的多模态智能。我致力于构建能够理解与生成二维、三维、视频及四维内容的视觉语言模型与生成模型。代表作包括 Perceptio 、UCanDance、PointNeXt 和 3D-CoMPaT 。\n","tags":null,"title":"李禹陈","type":"authors"},{"authors":["__**Yuchen Li**__","Amanmeet Garg","Shalini Chaudhuri","Rui Zhao","Garin Kessler"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1772323200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1772323200,"objectID":"54317d0d891c85905ce55b2e1ddbdbf8","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/arxiv2026perceptio/","publishdate":"2026-03-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/arxiv2026perceptio/","section":"publication","summary":"Perceptio 探索通过空间 token 生成增强视觉语言模型的感知能力，以支持复杂的二维与三维空间推理。","tags":["VLM","Spatial Reasoning","3D Perception"],"title":"Perceptio: Perception Enhanced Vision Language Models via Spatial Token Generation","type":"publication"},{"authors":["__**Yuchen Li**__","et al."],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1767225600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1767225600,"objectID":"2a06a51aad0f2957430a8c2f43543c30","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/underreview2026dance/","publishdate":"2026-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/underreview2026dance/","section":"publication","summary":"本研究利用长时序姿态扩散探索音乐驱动的舞蹈视频生成，重点关注稳健的动作合成和用于视频生成的姿态对齐。","tags":["Video Generation","Dance Generation","Diffusion Models","Pose"],"title":"Rethinking Music-Driven Dance Generation in 2D: Long-Horizon Pose Diffusion for Video Synthesis","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Habib Slim","Xiang Li","__**Yuchen Li**__","Mahmoud Ahmed","Mohamed Ayman","Ujjwal Upadhyay","Ahmed Abdelreheem","Arpit Prajapati","Suhail Pothigara","Peter Wonka","Mohamed Elhoseiny"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1735689600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1735689600,"objectID":"14b409ee3cc03c28098f9fdc9a1145d5","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/tpami2025compatpp/","publishdate":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/tpami2025compatpp/","section":"publication","summary":"3DCoMPaT++ 扩展了大规模三维组合式识别资源，用于研究材质、部件和物体层面的视觉理解。","tags":["3D Vision","Dataset","Compositional Recognition"],"title":"3DCoMPaT++: An Improved Large-scale 3D Vision Dataset for Compositional Recognition","type":"publication"},{"authors":["__**Yuchen Li***__","Guocheng Qian*","Houwen Peng","Jinjie Mai","Hasan Abed Al Kader Hammoud","Mohamed Elhoseiny","Bernard Ghanem"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1735689600,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1735689600,"objectID":"404c718fdcbe4353a25729da8b6dd09b","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/3dv2025pointnets/","publishdate":"2025-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/3dv2025pointnets/","section":"publication","summary":"本研究探索 PointNets 的扩展规律，分析改进的训练与扩展策略如何影响三维点云理解。","tags":["Point Cloud","3D Vision","Scaling Laws"],"title":"Exploring Scaling Laws of PointNets","type":"publication"},{"authors":["__**Yuchen Li***__","Ujjwal Upadhyay*","Habib Slim","Tezuesh Varshney","Ahmed Abdelreheem","Arpit Prajapati","Suhail Pothigara","Peter Wonka","Mohamed Elhoseiny"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1664582400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1664582400,"objectID":"3c936cffa62267872fc6c4ccfa3b9e63","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/eccv2022compat/","publishdate":"2022-10-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/eccv2022compat/","section":"publication","summary":"3D-CoMPaT 是用于研究物体部件材质组合的大规模三维视觉数据集。它支持基于物体几何、部件与材质外观的组合式识别，推动超越类别识别的三维物体理解。","tags":["3D Vision","Dataset","Compositional Recognition"],"title":"3D CoMPaT Dataset: Composition of Materials on Parts of 3D Things","type":"publication"},{"authors":["__**Yuchen Li***__","Guocheng Qian*","Houwen Peng","Jinjie Mai","Hasan Abed Al Kader Hammoud","Mohamed Elhoseiny","Bernard Ghanem"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1664582400,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1664582400,"objectID":"2d2ff7b27e914f335c3e2ff025d4b215","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/neurips2022pointnext/","publishdate":"2022-10-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/neurips2022pointnext/","section":"publication","summary":"PointNet++ 是点云理解领域极具影响力的神经网络架构。虽然近期网络的精度已超越它，我们发现许多性能提升源于更好的训练策略、数据增强、优化方法和更大的模型规模，而不仅仅是架构创新。我们系统研究 PointNet++ 的训练与扩展策略：首先，在不改变架构的情况下，将 ScanObjectNN 上的整体准确率从 77.9% 提升至 86.1%；其次，引入倒残差瓶颈设计和可分离 MLP，实现高效扩展，得到 PointNeXt。PointNeXt 可灵活扩展，在三维分类与分割任务上取得优异表现。","tags":["Point Cloud","3D Vision","Representation Learning"],"title":"PointNeXt: Revisiting PointNet++ with Improved Training and Scaling Strategies","type":"publication"},{"authors":["Ahmed Ayyad","__**Yuchen Li**__","Raden Muaz","Shadi Albarqouni*","Mohamed Elhoseiny*"],"categories":null,"content":"","date":1609459200,"expirydate":-62135596800,"kind":"page","lang":"zh","lastmod":1609459200,"objectID":"1e8248086f4189266822c7ea336e1f51","permalink":"https://www.liyc.pw/zh/publication/aaai2021fewshot/","publishdate":"2021-01-01T00:00:00Z","relpermalink":"/zh/publication/aaai2021fewshot/","section":"publication","summary":"本研究利用原型随机游走探索半监督小样本学习。","tags":["Few-Shot Learning","Meta Learning"],"title":"Semi-supervised few-shot learning with prototypical random walks","type":"publication"}]